  "body": "Step inside, unpack, and start making memories from day one in this stunning brand-new home designed for modern family living. \r\n-Spacious Family Living\r\nFeaturing 4 generous bedrooms, 2 versatile living areas, and 3 beautifully appointed bathrooms, this home offers plenty of space for everyone. The luxurious master suite boasts a walk-in wardrobe and a stylish ensuite, creating the perfect private retreat. The separate family room also offers the flexibility to be used as a 5th bedroom, home office, or media room.\r\n-Designed for Entertaining\r\nThe light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area flows effortlessly onto a sunny deck and easy-care garden—ideal for summer BBQs, family gatherings, or simply relaxing with a glass of wine after a long day.\r\n-Comfort All Year Round\r\nEnjoy central air conditioning, keeping your home warm and cosy in winter while staying cool and comfortable throughout summer.\r\n-Gourmet Kitchen\r\nCook with confidence in the modern kitchen, complete with premium appliances and gas cooking—perfect for everything from everyday family meals to entertaining guests.\r\n-Low-Maintenance Living\r\nSet on a freehold, easy-care section, you'll spend less time on upkeep and more time enjoying everything this fantastic home has to offer.\r\n\r\nUnbeatable Location\r\n\r\nConvenience is right at your doorstep:\r\n\r\nWalk to Hibiscus Coast Bus Station & Park & Ride\r\nWalk to McDonald's and local shops\r\nJust a 2-minute drive to the motorway for an easy commute\r\nClose to shopping centres, supermarkets, cafés, schools, and everyday amenities\r\nA short drive to beautiful beaches and all the lifestyle attractions the Hibiscus Coast has to offer\r\n\r\nThis exceptional home combines space, style, comfort, and convenience—making it the perfect choice for families, professionals, or savvy investors.\r\n\r\nDon't miss this fantastic opportunity—contact us today to arrange your viewing",
